us\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"Traceback (most recent call last):\\n  File \\\"<stdin>\\\", line 9, in <module>\\nAssertionError: trunk README line missing: contract rows, 36 pinned or catalog-referenced normative section keys, 77\\nFINAL SCOPE: 60 paths, no extras\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 223,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 56,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
